Raw Data
The raw Walmart datasets used for the analysis should be stored in this directory.
The project integrates multiple source tables covering:
- Historical weekly sales
- Store attributes
- External economic/environmental variables
- Holiday indicators
- Promotional/markdown variables where available
Raw source files are intentionally excluded from version control where licensing, size, or redistribution restrictions apply.
Document the original source, download date, and file names in the project documentation when adding the data locally.
